* news_process v3.2.0 — Table A5: 词典法对比 Dictionary Method Comparison (plan v14 §9.2)
*
* 词典法 vs LLM 法 robustness:
*   主 spec 用 LLM ensemble; 此表展示 6 个金融情感词典的同 spec 结果.
*   读者可对比 LLM vs Loughran-McDonald-style 词典法的 β 一致性.
*
* 词典清单 (Loughran & McDonald 2011 JF + 中文金融词典, v3.10.0 +第 6 部 L&M 中文主译):
*   jiang_2021, yao_2021, bian_2021, du_2022, you_2018, loughran (L&M 2011 中文全译)
*
* 方法学红线 (L&M 规则版 vs 纯计数版): 本管道对所有词典施加否定/程度/转折三条语言学
*   规则; 而 Loughran & McDonald (2011) 原版是**纯计数**. 故额外列出 loughran_negonly_tone
*   (仅否定翻转, 去程度/转折 ≈ L&M-faithful 计数版) 与全规则 loughran_tone 并排, 读者可验
*   两者 β 一致性 (预期高度相关 ≈0.998); 若符号翻转/幅度差 >10% 须在正文披露为数据质量信号.
*
* 政治词权重敏感性 (du_2022 政治正面词, 与其他词典法并列; 三权重互为稳健性、不分主次):
*   ① 依据 Du et al. (2022, Review of Finance) 政治正面词信号弱于普通正面词的发现, 对该类词
*      赋予降低的权重; ② 权重取 0.5 为研究者选择, 并做敏感性检验: 令政治词权重 ∈ {0.0, 0.5,
*      1.0} 三者互为稳健性、不分主次, 证明主结论不被这一取值驱动. 落地: du_2022 在本表以三列
*      并排 (pw=0 剔除政治词 / pw=.5 = 既有 du_2022_tone / pw=1 全权正侧), 与其余 5 部词典单列
*      并列. ⚠ 三权重各自 just-identified 独立列, 禁混同一 over-identified Hansen J (逐列并排
*      即正确呈现, 不并入同一 GMM 工具集).
*
* LLM/BERT 逐模型互为稳健性 (2026-07-02, option B): llm_vote = 三家多数投票共识 (canonical
*   headline); gpt54nano/gemini31/deepseekv4 三家 + finbert_cn/fin_sent_zh/finbert2 三 BERT 各自
*   并排列, co-equal 互为稳健性、不分主次, 证主效应不被任一模型驱动. ⚠ 各家/各模型各自
*   just-identified 独立列, 禁混同一 over-identified Hansen J; 真 FWER 校正见 27_tableA12.
*   ⚠ 全部情感 DV 经 z-score 标准化 (egen std): 2/3 分类 BERT 与 LLM/词典原始方差不同, 原始 β
*   不可比; 标准化后 β = 每 1 单位 X 引致的 DV 标准差数, 跨测度/跨模型可比 (镜像 benefit/15_table6).
*
* Main spec: locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}} subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}} sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

version 19

local LOCUS  tech_frac_{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}
local SUBST  symb_frac_{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}
local EXPL   digital_frontier

* V5 / st-table2-main-04 fix (2026-06-03): full 轨 (lf/sf) 展开成幻影列
* tech_frac_lf / symb_frac_sf (面板无, 只有裸名 tech_frac/symb_frac 与 ctx 轨
* tech_frac_lc/symb_frac_sc). 缺列时下方 reghdfe 引用为控制变量会 r(111) 崩.
* 加守卫: 缺列则置空, degrade 为不含 LOCUS/SUBST 的回归.
capture confirm variable `LOCUS' `SUBST'
if _rc {
    display "  ⚠️ LOCUS/SUBST 列缺 (`LOCUS' / `SUBST'): full 轨须用裸名, 见 stata_runner; 词典法回归 degrade 为不含 LOCUS/SUBST"
    local LOCUS
    local SUBST
}

* --- Main LLM 投票共识 (canonical headline) + 三家 per-model (co-equal 互为稳健, 不分主次) ---
* 2026-07-02 互为稳健性: 全部情感 DV 经 egen std 标准化 → 跨模型/跨测度 β 可比 (共用临时列 _sdv).
local LLM_DV  llm_vote_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
capture confirm variable `LLM_DV'
if !_rc {
    capture drop _sdv
    egen _sdv = std(`LLM_DV')
    eststo LLM_main: reghdfe _sdv `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
* 三家 LLM 逐模型 (co-equal 互为稳健, 不分主次; llm_vote 为共识 headline)
* ⚠ 三家各自 just-identified 并排, 禁混同一 over-identified Hansen J (FWER 见 27_tableA12).
foreach lm in gpt54nano gemini31 deepseekv4 {
    local LLM_M `lm'_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
    capture confirm variable `LLM_M'
    if !_rc {
        capture drop _sdv
        egen _sdv = std(`LLM_M')
        eststo LLM_`lm': reghdfe _sdv `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
    }
    else display "  Skip LLM `lm': var `LLM_M' not in panel"
}

* --- 词典法 Dictionary methods (6 个词典, v3.10.0 +loughran) ---
local dicts jiang_2021 yao_2021 bian_2021 du_2022 you_2018 loughran
foreach d of local dicts {
    local DICT_DV `d'_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
    capture confirm variable `DICT_DV'
    if !_rc {
        capture drop _sdv
        egen _sdv = std(`DICT_DV')
        eststo DICT_`d': reghdfe _sdv `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
    }
    else {
        display "  Skip dict `d': var `DICT_DV' not in panel"
    }
}

* --- L&M 纯计数版 (negonly ≈ L&M-faithful, 方法学红线) ---
* loughran_negonly_tone = 仅否定翻转、去程度/转折 → 最接近 Loughran-McDonald (2011) 原版纯计数;
* 与全规则 loughran_tone 并排, 验 β 一致性 (capture-confirm 守卫缺列优雅跳过)。
local LM_NEGONLY loughran_negonly_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
capture confirm variable `LM_NEGONLY'
if !_rc {
    capture drop _sdv
    egen _sdv = std(`LM_NEGONLY')
    eststo LM_negonly: reghdfe _sdv `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
else {
    display "  Skip LM_negonly: var `LM_NEGONLY' not in panel"
}

* --- du_2022 政治词权重敏感性 (三权重互为稳健性、不分主次; 与上方 6 词典法并列) ---
* Du et al. (2022, RoF) 政治正面词信号弱于普通正面词 → 生产口径 0.5 权重计入正侧; 0.5 为研究者
* 选择, 故并排 pw∈{0,0.5,1}. 中列 pw=.5 即上方 DICT_du_2022 (du_2022_tone), 此处补两翼:
*   pw=0 (du_2022_polw00_tone, 剔除政治词) 与 pw=1 (du_2022_polw10_tone, 政治词全权正侧).
* 每权重各自独立 reghdfe 列 (just-identified 并排, 禁混同一 over-identified Hansen J).
local DU_PW0 du_2022_polw00_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
capture confirm variable `DU_PW0'
if !_rc {
    capture drop _sdv
    egen _sdv = std(`DU_PW0')
    eststo DU_pw0: reghdfe _sdv `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
else {
    display "  Skip DU_pw0: var `DU_PW0' not in panel"
}
local DU_PW1 du_2022_polw10_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
capture confirm variable `DU_PW1'
if !_rc {
    capture drop _sdv
    egen _sdv = std(`DU_PW1')
    eststo DU_pw1: reghdfe _sdv `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
else {
    display "  Skip DU_pw1: var `DU_PW1' not in panel"
}

* --- BERT methods (三模型对照, co-equal 互为稳健; Phase 2 起可切 signed net_tone) ---
* 2026-07-02: 补齐三 BERT 并纳入 cand_models 展示 (原仅算不展示). ⚠ 三模型各自 just-identified 并排.
local berts finbert_cn_pos fin_sent_zh_pos finbert2_pos
foreach b of local berts {
    local BERT_DV `b'_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
    capture confirm variable `BERT_DV'
    if !_rc {
        capture drop _sdv
        egen _sdv = std(`BERT_DV')
        eststo BERT_`b': reghdfe _sdv `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
    }
    else {
        display "  Skip BERT `b': var `BERT_DV' not in panel"
    }
}

* 输出 — 注释更正 (2026-06-12): 旧注释声称 "esttab 部分缺失 spec 时仍输出可用列" 不实 —
* esttab 对缺名估计是 r(111) 硬崩 (同 12_table3 fix(omni-g-templates-14) 实证)。
* fix(S1-03, 2026-06-16): 改为动态名单化 (同 12_table3/13_table4/21_tableA2 idiom) —
* 仅引用实际已存储的估计, mtitle 同步删列防错位, 任一词典列缺失时优雅降级不再整表崩。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
* 列序 (2026-07-02): LLM 共识 + 三家 per-model / 6 词典 (du_2022 以 pw=0/.5/1 三元组) / L-M 计数 / 三 BERT.
* 三家不分主次, 与其余测度单列同排; 缺列由 capture-confirm 守卫 → 动态名单化优雅降级.
local cand_models LLM_main LLM_gpt54nano LLM_gemini31 LLM_deepseekv4 DICT_jiang_2021 DICT_yao_2021 DICT_bian_2021 DU_pw0 DICT_du_2022 DU_pw1 DICT_you_2018 DICT_loughran LM_negonly BERT_finbert_cn_pos BERT_fin_sent_zh_pos BERT_finbert2_pos
local cand_titles `""LLM vote" "GPT" "Gemini" "DeepSeek" "Jiang 2021" "Yao 2021" "Bian 2021" "Du22 pw=0" "Du22 pw=.5" "Du22 pw=1" "You 2018" "L-M 2026" "L-M counts" "FinBERT-cn" "FinSent-zh" "FinBERT2""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  ⚠️ Table A5 无任何已存储估计 (LLM/词典列全缺), 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' using "output/tables/tableA5_dictionary_method.tex", ///
        se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) ///
        booktabs replace fragment ///
        title("Table A5: LLM vs Dictionary vs BERT Sentiment (Robustness, standardized)") ///
        mtitles(`mtitles') ///
        note("DV: 情感分数 (z-standardized, egen std → 跨测度/跨模型 β 可比: 每 1 单位 X 引致的 DV 标准差数). " ///
             "LLM vote = 3 模型多数投票共识 (headline); GPT/Gemini/DeepSeek = 三家 per-model (co-equal 互为稳健). " ///
             "Dict = 6 个中文金融词典 (含 Loughran-McDonald 2011 JF 中文全译 L-M 2026). " ///
             "L-M counts = loughran negonly (仅否定, 去程度/转折), 最接近 L&M 原版纯计数; 与 L-M 2026 (全规则) 并排验稳健性. " ///
             "Du22 pw={0,.5,1} = 政治词权重敏感性 (Du et al. 2022, Review of Finance): 政治正面词信号弱于普通正面词, 故以降低权重计入; " ///
             "0.5 为研究者选择, 三权重互为稳健性、不分主次 (pw=.5 = 主口径 du_2022_tone), 证明结论不被该取值驱动; 三列各自 just-identified. " ///
             "FinBERT-cn/FinSent-zh/FinBERT2 = 三个中文金融 BERT per-model (co-equal 互为稳健). 每列各自 just-identified 并排; 跨模型 FWER 校正见 Table A12. " ///
             "IDENTIFICATION NOTE: digital_frontier is a base-year within-bank time-invariant 0/1 classifier; every " ///
             "column here uses absorb(bank_id year), so it is collinear with the bank FE and silently dropped — " ///
             "beta(digital_frontier) is identified only in a no-absorb column (see 11_table2 M1). These columns identify " ///
             "the within-bank time-varying terms (LOCUS/SUBST controls); the comparison is across sentiment measures, not " ///
             "across the frontier main effect.")

    display "✅ Table A5 written to output/tables/tableA5_dictionary_method.tex"
}
capture drop _sdv
